{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>紅磡寶來街50號發生有人墮樓死亡案件。今早（14日）7時許，警方接獲多名市民報案，指一名女子倒卧地上昏迷。警員到場後發現一名中年女子於行人路並已陷入昏迷、救護員到場後証實女事主當場不治。</p>\n<p>案件仍在調查中，警方列作有人從高處墮下處理。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:18:03.255169+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T01:15:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:34:32.413124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T02:11:20.355082+00:00","content_hash":"ad44add2fdca89fa1e231c715a3477cd9946e2226b120ac2b38999621b9a5486","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}